    "stem": "下列 Python 程式以貝氏定理計算後驗機率，執行後輸出為何？",
    "code": "p_a = 0.3\np_b_given_a = 0.8\np_b_given_not_a = 0.2\np_b = p_b_given_a * p_a + p_b_given_not_a * (1 - p_a)\nprint(round(p_b_given_a * p_a / p_b, 3))",
    "codeLanguage": "python",
    "verification": {
      "kind": "python-stdout",
      "expectedStdout": "0.632",
      "status": "verified",
      "runtime": "Pyodide 314.0.8（CPython 3.14.2）",
      "packages": {},
      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-19"
    },
    "codeWalkthrough": [
      "先驗 P(A) = 0.3，P(B|A) = 0.8，P(B|非A) = 0.2。",
      "全機率：P(B) = 0.8×0.3 + 0.2×0.7 = 0.24 + 0.14 = 0.38。",
      "貝氏定理：P(A|B) = 0.24 / 0.38 ≈ 0.6316。",
      "`round(..., 3)` 輸出 `0.632`。"
    ],
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "0.24"
